  "description": "[Hub Motors] The 1000W*2 powerful hub motors on the City Runnerelectric skateboard give it a top speed of 30 mph and a range of 47 miles, allowing it to adapt to various demand like college commuting, hanging out with friends, or riding around the city.\n\n[Smooth Braking and Modes] Riders benefit from a smooth braking experience due to the new ESC's sensitive M5 remote control system. The board is also IPX5 waterproof and has 4 settings, including an easy-to-use LO mode, that you may switch between to suit your daily activities.\n\n[Safe Charging] You can concentrate on having fun rather than worrying about battery life because the skateboard supports 2.5A charging, which takes approximately 2 hours to charge from zero to one hundred percent.\n\n[Package List] The City RunnerStandard Electric Skateboard's packing list includes the charger, charger adapter cable, remote control, skateboard repair tool, and user manual. Please read the instruction manual in detail before use, if you have any questions soversky is always ready to help you solve the problem.\n\nPackage\nN.W.\n\nG.W.",
